	(text "VALUE CHOICES - TPS61088 (10 A switch boost)\n- VOUT = VREF x (1 + R11/R12) = 1.204 V x (1 + 182k/56k) = 5.12 V\n    (5.10 V target in the JSON).\n- fSW ~ 500 kHz with R10 = 316k (FSW to SW): VERIFY against datasheet eq. 2.\n- I_LIM = 1 190 000 / R14 = 1.19e6 / 120k = 9.9 A peak (PFM), >= 8.6 A worst case.\n- Soft start t_SS = VREF x C14 / 5 uA = 1.204 V x 47 nF / 5 uA = 11 ms.\n- R13 6.8k + C13 6.8 nF: compensation starting point - VERIFY.\n- C11 100 nF BOOT-SW bootstrap;  C15 2.2 uF on the internal VCC LDO.\n- EN has an internal 800k pull-down: 5 V stays off until ESP_5V_EN goes high.  R15 1k series.\n- MODE left open = PFM at light load.  NC pins 11/12 tied to GND.\n- L2 2.2 uH, Isat 18 A, 7 mR.  Input C107-C109, output C110-C113 (4 x 22 uF).\n- Layout: keep the input loop C107-C109 / L2 / PGND tight (~7 A peak);\n    C110-C113 next to the VOUT pins; exposed pad = thermal path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 345.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42991e87-f944-4467-8637-c1c1650c247a")
	)
	(text "VALUE CHOICES - TPS63802 (2 A buck-boost)\n- VOUT = 0.5 V x (1 + R22/R23) = 0.5 x (1 + 511k/91k) = 3.31 V.  R23 <= 100k (TI recommendation).\n- EN as UVLO on P+:  on above 1.1 V x (1 + R20/R21) = 1.1 x 2.37 = 2.6 V,  off below ~1.0 V x 2.37 = 2.37 V.\n- MODE must not float: R24 100k -> power-save by default.  ESP_BB_MODE high (via R26 1k, DNP if unused)\n    forces PWM, e.g. while recording audio.\n- PG is open-drain: R25 100k pull-up to +3V3 (optional).\n- L3 0.47 uH, Isat >= 4 A, DCR <= 25 mR: part TBD (TI suggests Coilcraft XFL4015-471ME), no footprint yet.\n- C114 / C115 2 x 22 uF output: second cap for ToF / Wi-Fi load steps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320.04 317.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f96bd5b-f15c-44c5-be93-83996dc88bb8")
	)
	(text "VALUE CHOICES - HY2112-AB (1S LiFePO4 protection)\n- R1 100 R + C5 100 nF: VDD supply filter (tau = 10 us), per HY2112 datasheet.\n- R2 2k: CS series resistor, per datasheet.\n- Discharge over-current trips at V(CS) = 100 mV  ->  I_OCP = 100 mV / (RDS(on) M1 + RDS(on) M2): fill in from the WSD20100DN56 datasheet.\n- M1 = discharge FET (OD), M2 = charge FET (OC), back-to-back with a common drain (PROT_MID).\n- B- (cell side, before M1/M2) is NOT GND (system side, after M2 = P-). Never join them.\n- F3: PTC ~5 A hold, 2920 - part still TBD.\n- VBAT_ADC = P+ x R32 / (R30 + R32) = P+ / 2:  3.65 V -> 1.83 V on the ADC; divider draws 18 uA.\n    C6 100 nF holds the ADC sample.  Firmware cut-off 2.5 V.\n- VERIFY: BT1 polarity (pin 2 = + taken from the EasyEDA drawing, footprint has no mark);\n    M1/M2 pinout assumed 1-3 S, 4 G, 5-8 + EP D (no EasyEDA model, generic SSSGD symbol on TDSON-8-1).\n- F4/F5/F6 (PTC 3 A 1812, C2892380) live on the cardinal boards (Sthymuli-cardinalboard), not here.\n- Layout: M1/M2 and the P+ / B- / GND paths sized for ~7 A continuous."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320.04 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "72057776-0a1a-4d11-9a13-561d2e359f96")
	)
	(text "MODE open = PFM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.73 334.264 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8271160f-7ccc-493c-91b3-c8180e423890")
	)
	(text "GENERAL\n- Source of truth: power-stage-netlist.json.  Refs renamed to KiCad-numeric (JSON name in field JSON_Ref):\n    C1A/B/C = C102/103/104, C2A/B = C105/106, C10A/B/C = C107/108/109, C12A-D = C110-C113, C21A/B = C114/115, RCS = R16.\n- ESP32: NTC_ADC = IO5, VBAT_ADC = IO6, ESP_CHG_OFF = IO21, ESP_5V_EN = IO46, ESP_BB_MODE = IO45, CHG_CHRG = IO3,\n    CHG_DONE = MCP23017 GPA3, BB_PG = MCP23017 GPA4.\n- VBUS_IN comes from the USB-C / CH224D sink (not drawn yet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320.04 358.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "92082e6d-8976-400e-ad76-abc8a93b13bb")
	)
	(text "BOOST 5V  -  TPS61088 > +5V (3 A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 216.408 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a6f50bc-231c-4030-8556-f3fd098dd0a5")
	)
	(text "BUCK-BOOST 3V3  -  TPS63802 > +3V3 (always on above 2.6 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 313.69 216.408 0)
		(effects
			(font
