		)
		(uuid "c3d8e2b3-1ac0-4b99-b7a0-6547e49df146")
	)
	(text "PACK  -  main cell + PTC, HY2112-AB protection with M1/M2 back-to-back on the negative side, VBAT sense"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 313.69 13.208 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c820daba-15ac-4213-a1b2-d192affc3593")
	)
	(text "VALUE CHOICES - CN3801 (1S LiFePO4 buck charger)\n- CV = 3.625 V, fixed inside the CN3801 (LFP version): no feedback divider.\n- Charge current  I_CC = 120 mV / R16 = 120 mV / 30 mR = 4.0 A.   R16 dissipation 4^2 x 0.03 = 0.48 W (1 W part).\n- MPPT / input-sag limit:  VCC >= 1.205 V x (1 + R3/R4) = 1.205 x (1 + 274k/100k) = 4.51 V\n    -> the charger reduces current instead of pulling a weak USB source below 4.5 V.\n- R5 120 R + C4 220 nF on COM: loop compensation, datasheet values.\n- C3 100 nF is VG-to-VCC (not to GND): gate-driver supply, per datasheet.\n- D1 SS54 blocks the pack back-feeding VBUS through the Q1 body diode.  D2 SS54 = freewheel diode.\n- L1 10 uH, Isat 5.5 A  >  4 A charge current + ripple.\n- CHG_OFF: R6 100k keeps Q2 off -> charging enabled by default.  ESP_CHG_OFF high -> Q2 pulls MPPT low -> charge stops\n    (bench-verify).  R7 1k limits the GPIO current.\n- CHRG / DONE are open-drain: R8 / R9 10k pull-ups to +3V3.\n- NTC: NTC_ADC = 3.3 V x R_NTC / (R31 + R_NTC) = 1.65 V at 25 C (R31 = R_NTC(25C) = 10k).\n    Firmware stops charging outside 0..45 C via CHG_OFF.  Place TH1 against the main cell.\n- Layout: route CHG_CSP and the BAT (P+) sense line as a Kelvin pair from the R16 pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d9e3393f-6714-42a4-9119-0b077d263c49")
	)
	(text "CHARGER  -  USB VBUS > PTC > SS54 > CN3801 P-FET buck > 30 mR sense > P+"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
